#question(title: [Exp-trig antiderivative])[
  We want to compute
  $
    I = integral e^(a x) sin(b x) thick d x
  $

  - Try once integration by parts choosing
    $display(u = e^(a x))$. Stop.
  - Go back to $I$. Now try integration by
    parts once choosing
    $display(u = sin(b x))$ instead. Stop.
  - Look at what you did. Think.
]
